&gt;&gt; THIS IS SOMETHING THAT

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.209 line:0%
UKRAINE HAS BEEN ASKING FOR FOR

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.377 line:0%
A LONG TIME, JOHN, BUT I WANT

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.112 line:0%
TO STATE FROM THE VERY

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:21.014 line:0%
