00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:22.082 line:0%
DEFENSE SYSTEM WITHIN THE

00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:25.085 line:0%
UNITED STATES MILITARY IS WHAT

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:26.019 line:0%
IS CALLED A HIGH DEMAND, LOW

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:29.089 line:0%
DENSITY ITEM.

