THAT MEANS THERE IS NOT MANY --

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:33.159 line:0%
KINDS OF PIECES OF EQUIPMENT.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.128 line:0%
THERE IS A LOT TO THEM, IT'S

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:37.030 line:0%
MORE THAN JUST A MISSILE, AND

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:39.265 line:0%
THE MUSCLE ALONE, BY THE WAY,

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:40.266 line:0%
EACH MISSILE COST BETWEEN 3 AND

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.167 line:0%
5 MILLION DOLLARS, NOT THE

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:45.038 line:0%
LAUNCHER BUT THE MISSILE.

