IT HAS MISSILES, RADARS, A

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:47.307 line:0%
GENERATION SYSTEM AND A COMMAND

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:52.045 line:0%
AND CONTROL SYSTEM.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:54.080 line:0%
THIS IS A BIG ORGANIZATION THAT

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:56.416 line:0%
