00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:57.150 line:0%
ALTITUDE CAPABILITY OF SHUTTING

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:59.052 line:0%
DOWN --

00:01:57.317 --> 00:02:01.087 line:0%
