00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:08.128 line:0%
AGAINST DRONES OR SOME OF THE

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:09.229 line:0%
TYPES OF MISSILES THAT RUSSIA

00:02:08.294 --> 00:02:10.597 line:0%
HAS BEEN FIRING, OR IT SHOULD

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:12.232 line:0%
NOT BE THAT TYPE.

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:13.199 line:0%
YOU COULD BE WASTING A LOT OF

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:15.101 line:0%
MONEY TO DO THE.

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:16.269 line:0%
THE OTHER THING IS, IT TAKES A

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:19.339 line:0%
LOT OF PEOPLE, AND IT TAKES A

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:21.040 line:0%
LOT OF MAINTENANCE AND SUPPLIES

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:21.441 line:0%
TO KEEP THESE BATTERIES

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:24.210 line:0%
RUNNING.

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:27.046 line:0%
IT IS A VERY LARGE SYSTEM, IT

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:29.149 line:0%
HAS A LOT OF PEOPLE IN, AND THE

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:31.050 line:0%
TRAINING, TRUTHFULLY, JOHN,

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:32.152 line:0%
I'VE SEEN BASIC TRAINING FOR

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.053 line:0%
THOSE WHO FIRES MISSILES, AND

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:36.089 line:0%
THE REPAIRMAN AND SUPPLIERS, IT

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:38.258 line:0%
TAKES NOT WEEKS BUT MONTHS, AND

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:39.159 line:0%
IN SOME CASES, YEARS, TO LEARN

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:41.060 line:0%
THE SYSTEM.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:42.195 line:0%
UKRAINE HAS BEEN VERY GOOD,

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:44.030 line:0%
THEY ADAPTED SOME OF THE

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.664 line:0%
SYSTEMS WE'VE GIVEN THEM, AND

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:48.168 line:0%
THEY'VE DONE IT WELL.

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:49.202 line:0%
THIS IS A VERY COMPLEX AND HIGH

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.136 line:0%
TECHNOLOGY PIECE OF EQUIPMENT

00:02:49.369 --> 00:02:50.503 line:0%
THAT TAKES A LONG TIME TO

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:53.139 line:0%
LEARN.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:54.140 line:0%
&gt;&gt; TO YOUR POINT, THE U.S. ARMY

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:56.075 line:0%
DESCRIBED THE PATRIOT AS ITS

00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:57.243 line:0%
MOST ADVANCED AIR DEFENSE

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:59.078 line:0%
SYSTEM, CAPABLE OF DEFEATING

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:00.046 line:0%
BOTH HIGH PERFORMANCE AIRCRAFT

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:00.480 line:0%
AND TACTICAL BALLISTIC

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:03.917 line:0%
MISSILES.

00:03:03.249 --> 00:03:05.185 line:0%
IT HAS A PHASED ARRAY --

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:07.086 line:0%
PARDONING EQUIPMENT, UP TO 8

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:09.022 line:0%
WATCHERS, EACH WHICH HOLDS FOR

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:10.089 line:0%
READY TO FIRE MISSILES, THAT'S

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.324 line:0%
WHEN THE WATCH THEIR.

00:03:10.256 --> 00:03:14.060 line:0%
AS YOU SAY, UKRAINIANS HAVE

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:15.261 line:0%
BEEN REMARKABLY ADEPT AT

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:15.828 line:0%
LEARNING, BUT THIS IS A WHOLE

00:03:15.428 --> 00:03:16.996 line:0%
BEAST ALTOGETHER.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.031 line:0%
CNN IS REPORTING THAT CHENEY

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:21.034 line:0%
COULD ACTUALLY TAKE PLACE AT A

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:23.036 line:0%
U.S. BASE, SOMEWHERE IN GERMANY,

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:25.238 line:0%
SO IN TERMS OF ESCALATION FROM

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:26.105 line:0%
THE VIEW OF MOSCOW, HOW WOULD

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:27.207 line:0%
THEY SEE THAT?

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:29.175 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THEY WOULD SEE IT AS

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:31.010 line:0%
ESCALATION, BUT THE QUESTION

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.212 line:0%
THAT I THINK A LOT OF PEOPLE

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:35.148 line:0%
WOULD RESPOND WITH IS, SO WHAT?

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:36.983 line:0%
YOU KNOW, THEY HAVE BEEN

00:03:35.315 --> 00:03:39.219 line:0%
ESCALATING THIS WAR, KILLING

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:41.020 line:0%
CIVILIANS, ABDUCTING ILLEGAL

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:43.156 line:0%
ACTIVITIES, STRIKING

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:44.991 line:0%
INFRASTRUCTURE TARGETS, CAUSING

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:48.161 line:0%
THE CIVILIAN POPULATION OF

00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:50.096 line:0%
UKRAINE GREAT PAIN, SO IT IS

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:51.364 line:0%
ONLY AN ESCALATION TO DEAL WITH

00:03:50.263 --> 00:03:54.033 line:0%
THE KINDS OF THINGS THAT RUSSIA

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:56.202 line:0%
HAS BEEN DOING, SO THEY MAY SEE

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.104 line:0%
IT AS AN ESCALATORY RESPONSE,

00:03:56.369 --> 00:03:59.205 line:0%
BY THE UNITED STATES AND OTHER

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:02.075 line:0%
NATO COUNTRIES TO PROVIDE THIS

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:04.143 line:0%
KIND OF EQUIPMENT, BUT IT IS

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:05.245 line:0%
WHAT UKRAINE'S THE MANSE

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.146 line:0%
BECAUSE THEY WANT TO PROTECT

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.480 line:0%
THEIR CITIZENS FROM AN ILLEGAL

00:04:07.313 --> 00:04:10.083 line:0%
WAR.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:11.251 line:0%
&gt;&gt; AND YOU HAVE BEEN QUICK TO

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.418 line:0%
HIGHLIGHT THE FACT THAT IT'S

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:14.187 line:0%
NOT JUST THE COMPLEXITY OF THE

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:16.022 line:0%
PAGER SYSTEM BUT ALSO THE HIGH

00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:17.290 line:0%
NUMBER OF PERSONNEL NEED TO

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:20.159 line:0%
KEEP IT IN OPERATION.

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:21.127 line:0%
FOR CONTEXT, THIS IS NOT THE

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:23.229 line:0%
BATTERY, IF IT BATTALION AIR

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:25.298 line:0%
DEFENSE ARTILLERY, POSTING FOR

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.132 line:0%
A PHOTO ON A COMMISSION IN

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:29.402 line:0%
POLAND JUST LAST AUGUST.

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:30.370 line:0%
USUALLY ABOUT 90 SOLDIERS ARE

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:32.071 line:0%
ASSIGNED TO A BATTERY, BUT ONLY

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.505 line:0%
3 ARE NEEDED FOR COMBAT

00:04:32.238 --> 00:04:34.140 line:0%
PURPOSES.

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:37.076 line:0%
WHAT ARE THE CHANCES, IF THIS

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:38.077 line:0%
GOES AHEAD, SOME OF THOSE 90

00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:38.478 line:0%
PERSONNEL SUPPORT WILL BE U.S.

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:41.014 line:0%
TROOPS.

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:43.149 line:0%
&gt;&gt; I CAN'T SPEAK TO THAT,

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.250 line:0%
TRUTHFULLY, BECAUSE THE

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:45.251 line:0%
PRESIDENT AND THE SECRETARY OF

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:47.153 line:0%
DEFENSE HAVE BOTH SAID THAT

00:04:45.418 --> 00:04:48.187 line:0%
THERE WILL BE NO U.S. SOLDIERS

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.588 line:0%
ON THE GROUND INSIDE OF

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:52.058 line:0%
UKRAINE.

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:52.425 line:0%
THAT'S THE PROBLEMATIC PIECE OF

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:54.327 line:0%
THIS.

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:56.095 line:0%
IT MUST BE UKRAINIAN SOLDIERS

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:58.031 line:0%
THAT ARE TRAINED IN THIS,

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:59.232 line:0%
UNLESS WE CHANGE OUR POLICY,

00:04:58.197 --> 00:05:01.301 line:0%
UNLESS THE PRESIDENT SAYS, NO,

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:03.202 line:0%
I'LL AND MILITARY PERSONNEL IN.

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:04.270 line:0%
A LOT OF PEOPLE ON THE INTERNET

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.204 line:0%
ARE SAYING, WHY DON'T WE JUST

00:05:04.437 --> 00:05:06.306 line:0%
SEND CONTRACTORS?

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:08.041 line:0%
CONTRACTORS ARE THE SAME KIND

00:05:06.906 --> 00:05:09.976 line:0%
OF PROBLEMATIC THINGS.

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:11.077 line:0%
THEY ARE NORMALLY AMERICAN

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:11.844 line:0%
CONTRACTORS, BECAUSE THAT'S

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.980 line:0%
WHO'S DEVELOP THE SYSTEM.

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:16.015 line:0%
SO YOU STILL HAVE AMERICANS ON

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:17.984 line:0%
THE GROUND INSIDE OF A WAR

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:19.018 line:0%
BETWEEN RUSSIA AND UKRAINE, SO

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:22.055 line:0%
THAT IS PROBLEMATIC.

00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:24.057 line:0%
I DON'T FORESEE THAT POLICY

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:26.192 line:0%
CHANGING BY THE PRESIDENT, SO

00:05:24.924 --> 00:05:28.027 line:0%
IT IS A REQUIREMENT TO TRAIN

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:29.195 line:0%
UKRAINIAN SOLDIERS AND THEIR

00:05:28.194 --> 00:05:32.065 line:0%
SUPPORTERS ARE THESE VERY

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:34.033 line:0%
COMPLEX PIECES OF EQUIPMENT.

00:05:32.231 --> 00:05:35.201 line:0%
AS YOU SAID BEFORE, THERE ARE

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.103 line:0%
RUMORS THAT IT MAY BE TRAINED

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:38.271 line:0%
IN GERMANY, THE TRAINING BASE

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.340 line:0%
IN GERMANY IS ONE THAT I

00:05:38.438 --> 00:05:42.075 line:0%
COMMANDED IN SOUTHERN BAVARIAN.

00:05:40.873 --> 00:05:44.143 line:0%
THEY DON'T EVEN HAVE THE

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:46.045 line:0%
CAPABILITY TO LAUNCH MISSILES

00:05:44.911 --> 00:05:47.146 line:0%
AT THAT LOCATION BECAUSE THE

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:49.048 line:0%
RANGES ARE TOO SMALL.

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:50.149 line:0%
THEY COULD CERTAINLY DO

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:51.284 line:0%
SIMULATION TRAINING, AND THEY

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:52.385 line:0%
COULD LEARN THE PIECES OF

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:54.153 line:0%
EQUIPMENT, BUT YOU WOULD NOT

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.787 line:0%
GET ANY LIVE LUNCHES AT THE

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.090 line:0%
EQUIPMENT DOWN THERE.

00:05:54.954 --> 00:05:59.092 line:0%
IF IT ALL BE IN SIMULATIONS, IF

00:05:57.256 --> 00:06:01.127 line:0%
THEY DECIDE TO DO IT.

00:05:59.258 --> 00:06:02.495 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THERE'S OBVIOUSLY, IT SEEMS,

00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:03.229 line:0%
A LOT TO GO BEFORE THIS BECOMES

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:04.964 line:0%
REALITY, SIR.

00:06:03.396 --> 00:06:06.199 line:0%
GOOD TO SEE YOU, GENERAL

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:08.034 line:0%
HURTLING, THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

00:06:06.366 --> 00:06:08.434 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ALWAYS A PLEASURE, JOHN,

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:13.239 line:0%
THANKS.

00:06:12.205 --> 00:06:15.074 line:0%
&gt;&gt; TROOP READINESS IN BELARUS

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:16.242 line:0%
IS SPARKING CONCERNS THAT

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:18.111 line:0%
RUSSIA'S LONGTIME ALLY MAY BE

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:18.511 line:0%
OPENING TO OPEN A 2ND EFFORT IN

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:19.946 line:0%
UKRAINE.

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:21.180 line:0%
SOME NOTES EARLIER THIS YEAR

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:22.348 line:0%
JUST BEFORE RUSSIA INVADED

00:06:21.347 --> 00:06:23.816 line:0%
UKRAINE, BUT AS CNN'S WILL

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.417 line:0%
RIPLEY REPORTS, THIS TIME, THE

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:24.684 line:0%
UKRAINIANS ALREADY.

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:30.790 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE JUST ARRIVED AT A

00:06:30.089 --> 00:06:31.991 line:0%
UKRAINIAN MILITARY FORD

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:33.059 line:0%
OPERATING BASE HERE AT THE

00:06:32.158 --> 00:06:34.994 line:0%
BELARUSIAN BORDER, WHERE THEY

00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:35.895 line:0%
WILL SHOW US THE FORTIFICATIONS

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:37.930 line:0%
THAT THEY HAVE PUT IN PLACE TO

00:06:36.062 --> 00:06:38.598 line:0%
PROTECT AGAINST A POTENTIAL

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:40.767 line:0%
RUSSIAN GROUND INVASION.

00:06:38.765 --> 00:06:42.802 line:0%
&gt;&gt; A FEW MILES AWAY IN

00:06:40.933 --> 00:06:44.137 line:0%
NEIGHBORING BELARUS, AND

00:06:42.969 --> 00:06:45.905 line:0%
OMINOUS SHOW OF FORCE.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.940 line:0%
RUSSIAN AND BELARUSIAN TROOPS

00:06:46.072 --> 00:06:49.809 line:0%
HOLDING GOING TO COMBAT DRILLS,

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:51.144 line:0%
LIKE THEY DID EARLIER THIS YEAR,

00:06:49.976 --> 00:06:52.979 line:0%
JUST BEFORE THE INVASION.

00:06:51.644 --> 00:06:54.781 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU CONCERNED ABOUT THE

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:55.181 line:0%
TROOP BUILDUP ON THE BELARUSIAN

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:56.149 line:0%
BORDER?

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:58.918 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE TO BE CONCERNED

00:06:56.315 --> 00:07:01.888 line:0%
